ned}\n$$\n\nTo apply the first elementary row operation to the matrix $A,$ we multiply by ${E}_{1}$ on the left and get ${E}_{1}A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A\n$$\n\nThen, to apply the second elementary row operation to ${E}_{1}A,$ we multiply by ${E}_{2}$ on the left and get ${E}_{2}{E}_{1}A:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -4 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot A\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311865 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a70a48ac-dad6-5dc6-938a-8e2f8133296d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310095}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a70a48ac-dad6-5dc6-938a-8e2f8133296d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310095} :answer-field/id #uuid "1076bb95-e952-5d02-8472-b2f52c865eef" :answer-field/key "field-8" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310837} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b6c67d71-52aa-5409-9830-8401645fc37f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310227}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b6c67d71-52aa-5409-9830-8401645fc37f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310227} :answer-field/id #uuid "3fec9d16-c062-5b5b-b693-27eda534afbf" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310965} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e4a4384b-9701-5fda-99f2-e31da2469d44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #